{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261012/photo/bkn-20261012220104371-1012_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261012221057\"/><p>案發富澤花園一單位。</p><p>北角發生盜竊案。今午(12日)5時19分，炮台山道32號富澤花園有男住戶報案，指其姓黃(65歲)妻子一批約值40萬港元的珠寶不見了，懷疑被人盜去。</p><p>警員接報到場經調查後，相信案件與外傭有關，遂以涉嫌「盜竊」罪，拘捕涉案的33歲菲律賓籍女傭，她現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T14:21:06.197522+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T14:01:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T14:57:41.736517+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:18:48.585364+00:00","content_hash":"060fd77052500cc3a8e2feda534a16b33b7dc5b3bfbdd6f4a081225f9a5fe412","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}